ries/breakthrough-2016-12-14","order":541,"story_date":"2016-12-14","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":70,"quote":"\"It's finished.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=%22It%27s%20finished.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Breakthrough","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-12-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=%22It%27s%20finished.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Breakthrough\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Dec 2016."}},{"id":"breakthrough-2016-12-14-e7","era":null,"summary":"Setting the target, Rashmi's mind is pulled through the phantom dimensions and she glimpses many other worlds before Tezzeret's footsteps pull her back.","participants":["rashmi"],"location":"spire-inquirium","importance":"major","page":"stories/breakthrough-2016-12-14","order":541,"story_date":"2016-12-14","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":89,"quote":"And then she was Rashmi, the elf, kneeling on the floor in the Inquirium","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=And%20then%20she%20was,floor%20in%20the%20Inquirium","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Breakthrough","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-12-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=And%20then%20she%20was,floor%20in%20the%20Inquirium","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Breakthrough\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Dec 2016."}},{"id":"breakthrough-2016-12-14-e8","era":null,"summary":"R