2-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=I%20will%20bring%20your,name%E2%80%94to%20complete%20the%20transporter","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Breakthrough\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Dec 2016."}},{"id":"breakthrough-2016-12-14-e10","era":null,"summary":"Rashmi chooses to save Mitul over the dimensions she has seen.","participants":["rashmi","mitul"],"location":"spire-inquirium","importance":"major","page":"stories/breakthrough-2016-12-14","order":541,"story_date":"2016-12-14","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":128,"quote":"And she would choose Mitul.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=And%20she%20would%20choose%20Mitul.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Breakthrough","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-12-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=And%20she%20would%20choose%20Mitul.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Breakthrough\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Dec 2016."}},{"id":"breakthrough-2016-12-14-e11","era":null,"summary":"Rashmi secretly sends a warning note to Mitul through the old transporter ring while distracting Tezzeret.","participants":["rashmi","mitul","tezzeret"],"location":"spire-inquirium","importance":"major","page":"stories/breakthrough-2016-12-14","order":541,"story_date":"2016-12-14","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":142,"quote":"dropping the ball of paper through the ring. It disappeared.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/breakthrough-2016-12-14#:~:text=dropping%20the%20ball%20of,the%20ring.%20It%20disappear